### 1. Where membershipTier is assigned (BRONZE / SILVER / GOLD)

**File:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`

The tier is computed at DTO-mapping time (not persisted on the entity) by `resolveMembershipTier(Owner)`, wired in via the `@Mapping` on `toOwnerDto` (line 29):

```java
@Mapping(target = "membershipTier", expression = "java(resolveMembershipTier(owner))")
OwnerDto toOwnerDto(Owner owner);
...
/**
 * Resolves the owner's membership tier: {@code SILVER} when the owner has no namesakes
 * (namesakeCount is 0) and an email is present, otherwise {@code BRONZE}.
