```

**Important finding:** This method only ever returns `SILVER` or `BRONZE`. `GOLD` (`OwnerDto.MembershipTierEnum.GOLD`) is **never assigned anywhere in main source** — the only reference to GOLD is the acceptance test (see section 5). There is no household-size logic in tier resolution, even though `householdId` is tracked.

### 2. The Owner entity

**File:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`

